stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> unreviewed
    unreviewed --> confirmed : Review reason
    unreviewed --> false_positive : Triage reason
    unreviewed --> accepted_risk : Acceptance reason
    confirmed --> fixing : Repair planned
    confirmed --> false_positive : Triage reason
    confirmed --> accepted_risk : Acceptance reason
    fixing --> confirmed : Repair abandoned
    fixing --> pending_verification : Repair declaration exists
    fixing --> accepted_risk : Acceptance reason
    pending_verification --> fixing : Retest still present
    pending_verification --> closed : Latest evidenced retest
    pending_verification --> accepted_risk : Acceptance reason
    closed --> confirmed : Reopened with reason
    false_positive --> unreviewed : Reconsidered
    accepted_risk --> confirmed : Reconsidered
